go-for-it-qt (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major Release 2.0.0: Full C++20 / Qt 6 rewrite with GUI and TUI clients.
  * Native issue tracker and task integrations: GitHub, GitLab, Jira, YouTrack, Redmine, Todoist, and Nextcloud Tasks (CalDAV/VTODO).
  * Multi-account and multi-list aggregate views with per-integration remote status and priority mapping.
  * Full Vim-style Terminal UI (go-for-it-tui) with ANSI color-coded priorities and keyboard workflow.
  * Productivity Analytics Dashboard with Pomodoro charts, tag distribution, activity heatmap, and PDF/CSV billing reports.
  * Always-on-top Mini-Player (PiP) window for uninterrupted focus.
  * Due dates (due:YYYY-MM-DD) and smart filters (Today, Overdue, This Week).
  * Procedural Ambient Focus Sound Generator (White Noise, Rain, Ticking Clock).
  * Quick task jump to browser (xdg-open) via 'w'/'gx' in TUI and link button in GUI.

 -- Yurii Myronchuk <bladeroot@gmail.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 04:30:00 +0100

